  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "baby is mapped as a picture of child birth",
  "description": "The text 'rare picture of child birth' is overlaid on the image of a baby exploring a dishwasher. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'baby' is falsely equated with the textual concept 'child birth'. The mapping is absurd and misleading, projecting the visual material (the baby) onto the textual material (child birth) in a way that trivializes the profound event of childbirth. The baby, in this mapping, is being presented as the visual representation of childbirth, despite being a mundane scene of infant curiosity.",
